            "line": 120,
            "text": "theorem RiseSegs.pos : ∀ {segs : List (ℝ × ℝ)} {l : ℝ}, RiseSegs l segs → ∀ p ∈ segs, 0 < p.2\n  | [], _, _, p, hp => by simp at hp\n  | (c, m) :: rest, _, h, p, hp => by\n    obtain ⟨-, hm, hrest⟩ :="
